appeared in xtc 2.2, as did the guarantee that a drain never hands the
sink a record a writer has not finished.
.Fn xtc_logf ,
.Fn xtc_logf_to ,
.Fn xtc_logf_impl ,
and
.Fn xtc_logarg
appeared in xtc 2.2.
